[I] Library to split mp3 and ogg files without decoding

[T] libmp3splt is a library for splitting mp3 and ogg vorbis files at given
[T] time points or by detected silence without decoding them, preserving the
[T] audio quality. It is the core of the mp3splt and mp3splt-gtk tools.

[U] https://mp3splt.sourceforge.net/

[A] Libmp3splt Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[E] opt flac
[E] opt doxygen
[E] opt graphviz

